# Spring Boot 3 Quick Reference Cheat Sheet

## 1. REST Controller
```java
@RestController
@RequestMapping("/api")
public class Controller {
    @GetMapping("/status")
    public Map<String, String> status() {
        return Map.of("status", "UP");
    }
}
```

## 2. Jakarta Validation
- `@NotNull` - Null check
- `@NotBlank` - String must not be empty or whitespace
- `@Positive` - Number > 0
- `@Email` - Valid RFC email format

## 3. Java 21 Records
Records are shallowly immutable data carriers that provide canonical constructor, equals(), hashCode(), and toString() automatically.
